{"articleNo":"1674","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=1674&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"교보생명 대학생자원봉사단 2기 모집 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.03.26","hit":"11794","attachments":[{"name":"교보생명 대학생자원봉사단 2기 지원신청서.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=1674&attachNo=70908"},{"name":"교보생명 대학생자원봉사단 2기 모집요강.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=1674&attachNo=70924"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><br></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" align=\"center\"><font size=\"4\">「교보생명 대학생자원봉사단 2기」모집 안내</font></p>\n<font size=\"4\">\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><br></p>\n</font>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><font size=\"4\"><br></font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><font size=\"4\">&nbsp;1. 지원자격 : 국내,외 대학교 재(휴)학생</font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><font size=\"4\">&nbsp;2. 활동내용 : 1) 지역사회 내 기관에서의 자원봉사활동</font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><font size=\"4\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 교보생명 청소년자원봉사캠프(장애인생활시설)</font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><font size=\"4\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;3) 자원봉사 가이드북 제작</font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><font size=\"4\">&nbsp;3. 선발인원 : 총 100명 내외</font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><font size=\"4\">&nbsp;4. 신청기간 : 2011년 4월 8일(금)까지</font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><font size=\"4\">&nbsp;5. 신청방법 : 교보생명교육문화재단 홈페이지에서 온라인 접수</font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" align=\"left\"><font size=\"4\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(<span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"><a href=\"http://www.kbedu.or.kr/\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">http://www.kbedu.or.kr</font></a></span>)<br><br>&nbsp;6. 기타자세한 사항은 붙임 참조<br><br>붙임&nbsp; 1. 교보생명 대학생자원봉사단 2기&nbsp;모집요강 1부. <br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2. 교보생명 대학생자원봉사단 2기 지원신청서 1부.&nbsp; 끝.<br><br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 학&nbsp; 생&nbsp; 처<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2011. 03. 26.</font></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
